  <item>
    <title>我们的原创音乐剧“Dunhuang”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692f23c44ef12f9fe993618b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692f23c44ef12f9fe993618b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Dec 2025 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很久很久不更新了，因为一直没有找到想要做的题材，直到现在。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于我们的原创音乐剧“Dunhuang”：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>我们于2024年夏天启动了这个音乐剧项目，并在2025年3月与8月先后完成了剑桥首演及爱丁堡艺穗节的演出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从剧本到全部13首音乐，所有内容均为原创。更值得庆祝的是，我们达成了最初设定的小目标，那就是实现了收支平衡 🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><br><span>如果您想观看我们完整的演出录像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>剑桥版：</span><a href="https://youtu.be/dy31hd5k2NI" data-url="https://youtu.be/dy31hd5k2NI"><span>youtu.be</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱丁堡版：</span><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/18MBnuUSwx7Q9jhdQOFZafw" data-url="https://pan.baidu.com/s/18MBnuUSwx7Q9jhdQOFZafw"><span>pan.baidu.com</span></a><span>（🔑：7568）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dunhuang的🍠：“Dunhuang：A Musical 敦煌”</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾及主持人介绍：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>这一期凑齐了原创音乐剧“Dunhuang”背后绝望的爹（蟑螂脚）、溺爱的妈（李同学）以及操心但迷茫的姨（小孔同学）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>蟑螂脚：Dunhuang的编剧、导演及总制作（拥有微博爆料同款的世界上最渣录音音质...蟑螂脚在此给各位听众鞠躬致歉了，请大家海涵）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小孔同学：Dunhuang的主演及制作人之一，15场表演全勤（超强空间感录音拥有者）</span></p><span></span><p><span>李同学：Dunhuang的制作人之一</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间轴：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 开场音乐（Dunhuang song 1）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 故事速通+部分音乐欣赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 张骞和敦煌的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> alai穿越啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> King Shibi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> Water in Water</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> Fate</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 不同人对这个剧本的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">01:15:00</a> &nbsp;干货/避雷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> 场地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 找赞助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 面试演员和演员数量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 服装道具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 剑桥演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">01:12:00</a> 爱丁堡演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">01:12:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5050">01:24:10</a> 快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5060">01:24:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5230">01:27:10</a> Dunhuang Blue （剑桥版以及爱丁堡版混剪）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>场照：</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkxW5exqb6aV-5d6sm7FWHzrOSIC.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhNHqnWitUcFCjz7ItuqMqPWQkVc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrMc_WreMAxZqFjWV3y62DNyeVCC.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk6SzQTA5Ff2VHDFxIQUOI9F3tvU.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgw8IKbvs6lvPpC0T9mCalhd60Eu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo6tjc6mGkL6nxwEVEE4SYnjpRqy.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
