    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Will</span></p><span></span><p><span>剑桥工程硕士，2024暑假剑桥-&gt;中国行组织者之一</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 怎么想到办这次中国行的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">4:35</a> 怎么吸引到外国同学来参加这次中国行的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">9:07</a> 都有谁参与了这次活动的组织？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 如何建立参与者对组织者的信任？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 为什么安排三个可选的旅行时间？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 活动反响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> 最大的困难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> 未来还打算做中国行吗？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>背景音乐：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>“Popcorn Song” by Planet Custard</span></p><span></span><p><span>MV youtube link： <a data-url="https://youtu.be/Tm-S8o-CoHI?si=1kvGSMR0EMQWvhTc" href="https://youtu.be/Tm-S8o-CoHI?si=1kvGSMR0EMQWvhTc">youtu.be</a></span></p><span></span><h2><span>欢迎关注我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书：大学爆米花</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：早c晚sleep</span></p>]]></description>
