  <item>
    <title>牛津中国论坛知多少</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bfbde533591c27bea8036d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bfbde533591c27bea8036d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>嘉宾:</span></h2><span></span><p><span>山芋</span></p><span></span><p><span>2024/25届Oxford China Forum 牛津中国论坛主席</span></p><span></span><p><span>【OCF 公众号】OCF论坛</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>*山芋在本期播客内的发言不代表OCF官方立场</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>OCF基础信息：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>OCF活动以一年一度在3月于牛津举办的主论坛为主，其他月份的独立活动为辅。3月的论坛通常围绕一个大主题展开，并设有8-10个分论坛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>"OCF 成立于2013年，在牛津大学和牛津大学中国中心的指导下，致力于搭建中英学术交流平台，是全欧最大的中国论坛之一。论坛累计邀请包括前联合国秘书长潘基文、前澳大利亚总理陆克文、前英驻华大使韩魁发、真格基金创始人徐小平、华谊兄弟总裁王中磊、导演谢飞和文牧野、艺术家金星、建筑家王澍、作家许知远在内等300余位嘉宾，历届论坛全球直播累计观看人数超过1000万人次。"</span><em><span>--摘自OCF小红书账号置顶贴文</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>时间轴：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 开场+嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 关于OCF的背景知识：</span></p><span></span><p><span>历史、初衷；</span></p><span></span><p><span>和牛津大学的关系；</span></p><span></span><p><span>举办形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 分会场主题如何决定？大主题的作用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 筹备&amp;举办过程和其中的困难:</span></p><span></span><p><span>赞助商、资金来源和现金流；</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾的搭配和邀请</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 关于即将到来的9月OCF论坛的预告</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>9/6-7</span></strong><span> 上海线下论坛：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1） &nbsp;新质生产力--新能源汽车</span></p><span></span><p><span>2） &nbsp;新质生产力--智能革命</span></p><span></span><p><span>3） &nbsp;粮食升级与持续发展安全</span></p><span></span><p><span>4） &nbsp;文化论坛</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>9/22</span></strong><span> 线上论坛：出海企业，AI和法律…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 展望明年3月的OCF论坛</span></p><span></span><p><span>1-2月开始宣发，记得关注公众号哦！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>背景音乐：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>“Popcorn Song” by Planet Custard</span></p><span></span><h2><span>欢迎关注我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书：大学爆米花</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：早c晚sleep</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvsE5IBSbvnwky8P4EK8g9qkTxD4.m4a" length="33615220" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnJCf9xuMYWF-ca5YiUy4-Dw7Kmv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>女大十八辩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669a12578fcadceb907257e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669a12578fcadceb907257e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>姜姜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>教育心理专业新毕业生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Fran</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>经济系大二学生</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fran和姜姜在过去的一学年中共同担任剑桥华文辩论社团联席队长。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>*嘉宾均以个人身份接受采访，并不代表剑桥华辩社官方立场。</span></em></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 开场+嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 华辩赛制</span></p><span></span><p><span>赛制可以有变化，比较常见的如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>一二三四辩，两个持方</span></p><span></span><p><span>一辩陈词，四辩质询</span></p><span></span><p><span>对辩：两方限时交替发言，穿插陈词和小结</span></p><span></span><p><span>盘问：三辩向对方一、二、四辩提问</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由辩论：混战，计时</span></p><span></span><p><span>四辩总结成词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 喜欢的辩位和原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 竞技场上的策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 印象深刻的辩论赛经历和辩题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> 华文辩论的吸引力</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱思考、爱语言表达，就来华辩吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 华辩夏令营幕后大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 思考：在异国他乡背景下华文社团的定位、意义、使命</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 音量警告）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>欢迎关注我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书：大学爆米花</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：早c晚sleep</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>“Popcorn Song” by Planet Custard</span></p><span></span><p><span>MV youtube link： youtu.be</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhkuUItI7kaw4BtaiVGz2ZdTHmzZ.m4a" length="41613801" type="audio/mp4"/>
