  <item>
    <title>医学是信仰！！...吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a8a624b21ecc647da2213a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a8a624b21ecc647da2213a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Jul 2023 23:56:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>医学=生命、责任…</span></p><span></span><p><span>医学=学不完、又臭又长的专有名词…</span></p><span></span><p><span>到底是谁在学医学？大学医学在学什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当年意气风发宣布自己要读医学的同学现在依然对自己的选择坚定不移吗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>壹壹：剑桥大学大一医学系学生（</span><em><span>小红书 @壹只剑桥医学生</span></em><span>）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间轴：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 医学考试现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 为什么坚定地选医学？有选课门槛吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 生化、生理等学科的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 大学如何细化原有的生物知识？生理、生化的例子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 是否要求阅读课外研究报告？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>培养方向是学术性、研究性还是实践、临床？</span></p><span></span><p><span>和学科本身性质有关？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>剑桥和英国其他医学院的课程设置上的区别：先是全理论</span></p><span></span><p><span>学习根本理论和模仿的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> 英国vs新加坡vs国内？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 英国医疗系统等待时间长，何来医疗时间充裕？</span></p><span></span><p><span>关心病人是更好地治愈一个病人的重要一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 专科和全科医生培训的区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 后不后悔选了医学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 对未来的展望：大学选课？未来就业？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>BGM：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>“Popcorn Song” by Planet Custard（</span><em><span>MV youtube link： youtu.be</span></em><span>）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>欢迎关注我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书：大学爆米花</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：早c晚sleep</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk9z1Lx8307AG-hTpOFLVFx9Y2T8.m4a" length="55187730" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqR0luVjcxbTNFMEctTE1Uakt6UnB2YktrdzcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>六月读书——从疫苗研发到医生精进</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649e9d7f63a61044f4e83351</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649e9d7f63a61044f4e83351</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Jun 2023 09:16:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>6月最后一天了，朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们荣幸邀请到</span><strong><span>喵喵同学</span></strong><span>一起聊聊关于医学相关的两本书，喵喵目前大一，是一名医学生，医院的实习经历能更好的给我们一些相关信息。两本书简介如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>李同学：</span><strong><span>《 The Vaccine 》</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>内容概括：BionTech, 一家做个性化癌症药物的公司投入研发流行病疫苗，最后成功了，对公司和医学领域都有重要意义。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>商业角度上讲：这为未来的癌症药物研发带来了资金</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>医学角度讲：为流行病疫苗研制开拓了新思路，或许能加速未来疫苗研制（通过快捷替换mRNA的方式），也是为什么新冠病毒出现变种之后研发人员并不是特别紧张。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>“Independent and simultaneous discoveries are built upon, sometimes in silos, until individuals and ideas somehow merge, and human endeavor takes a giant, collective leap forward. You cannot reverse engineer this process. It is more than the sum of its parts.”</span></p><span></span><p><span>Excerpt From: Joe Miller. “The Vaccine”. Apple Books.</span></p><span></span><p><span>路人贾：</span><strong><span>《医生的精进从仁心仁术到追求卓越》</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>简介：作者阿图葛文德通过真实的案例和个人经历，展示了仁心仁术对于患者康复和整体医疗环境的重要性。精湛医术只是进入医者殿堂的第一步，走进这一行，便要迎接外人所不知的考验。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>到底如何追求完美？是不是完全没有希望？ 如果说“鹰眼，狮心，女人手”是外科医生的标配，那葛文德会告诉你，低配置+高效率，也完全可以去追求完美！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">9:05</a> 疫苗研发成功以后</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> BioNTech领头的科学家身上我们看到了什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 除了勇气，还需要实力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 医生的“勤奋”，从好好洗手开始</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> 酒精凝胶的推广背后真的难</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 喵喵医院实习经历真实分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Music by Iron/Wine "Naked As We Came"</span></p><span></span><h3><span>欢迎关注我们：</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>公众号：早c晚sleep</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>小红书：大学爆米花</span></h3>]]></description>
